<FONT SIZE="2" FACE="Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif">
Morning Everyone,<P>Just had a few questions that came to mind after last nights adventure in Velks.  I heard Nef say he had gotten 1 yellow bubble into 54 already while we were there.  Where are you getting all that exp Nef?  inside velks?  I've been 54 for around 2 months now, and I'm only 3 blues ahead of you. hehe I really dislike VL, it reminds me of a deadlier version of BlackBurrow.  Seems to be a lot of people in that zone who don't have a clue as to how things work.<P>Next question.  Is alpha group agreed on going for giant faction?  If yes, then I could use some help killing coldain for faction.   <IMG SRC="smile.gif" border="0">  I can solo till i'm blue in the face on the coldain between the Thurgadin entrance and the shardwurm cave entrance, but it gets really boring by myself.  Not sure if there would be any exp to be gained for you all there, but it would be faction, plus the opportunity for coldain heads exists.  Turning them in gets very significant faction gains, and they also sell for a decent amount of cash to people who don't want to take the time.  I'd also like to do some of the coldain camps in East wastes, there are a few that occasionally pop as blue to me, and exp is always nice.<P>Third.  Anyone need a sebilis key other than me?  I'd kinda like to get a group to get keys, and maybe run the "rare cycle" for a few hours.  The hunter and forager are both level 45, so would be some exp while we do it, plus all the rares are right around 50th level.  I'm sure I'm not the only one that would like an Iksar BP, or the rogue/bard mask, or the hangmans noose, or the prayer shawl, or... :P<P>Anyone have any other ideas for things to do?  Either for faction, experience, or loot?  I'd kinda like to get some exp, but I'm also still working on gathering up gear.   <IMG SRC="frown.gif" border="0">  <P>My current wishlist for Lownar includes:<BR>Gatorscale Sleeves, 8INT/8STR necklace, Kunzar Cloak, Braided Cinch Cord, Drachnid Thyxl/GBS, Shardwurm Eye/Students Homework, Words of Darkness.  <BR>My current wishlist for Kalaan includes:<BR>Sentry Arms, Sentry Legs, Sentry Bracer, Ry'gorr Collar, 2 AC6/65HP rings, Slime Coated harpoon, FBSS.<P>My lists are getting shorter at least, but now I'm getting down to the expensive and no-drop stuff.  So I either need to start making some cash (which i'm not doing in Velks), or start getting some drops that I can sell for cash (Rare-Cycle off Forager/Hunter, Droga Chief).<P>Well, enough from me for the moment.<p>[ July 31, 2001: Message edited by: Lownar/Kalaan/Sendil ]<P>--------------------<P>Lownar Baardeth - 55th Level Gnecromancer<BR>Kalaan - 30th Level Rogue<BR>Rakasak - 19th Level Monk<BR>Bertox. Server
