Yes Lownar, the back room of Velk's was great for exp. I got about 3 blues in 4-5 hours back there. And virtually no chance of trains back there. Cura and I were able to do a little over a blue in about 2 hours in CS the other day, but would probly be slower with 2 54's. <P>But Nef and Lownar could own the bulthars, until a herdmaster popped. And now that I'm 54 I could pull more wyvrens that would be blue to you.<P>Putz gnome, I had a Kunzar cloak for you the day I gave you the festering. You said you wanted the festering more, so I still have it in the bank for ya.<P>I know I have my Sebillis key, Ghall and Sleethr started theirs but no clue if they finished it. I wouldn't mind getting Mere a key, and I'm sure Verser would want one someday too.<P>So far I love Velk's. Its been great exp everytime I've gone, even when I die. I'm starting to see why no one camps that ledge though. I have died there more times than I can remember now. Up higher was always good, or the back room or right room were also good.<P>--------------------<P><B>Nefarius Draconocissor</B> - 55 Perserver/Freelance Gynocologist/Traitor to Division 13<BR><B>Meretrixx</B> - 48 Warrior<BR>Bertoxxolus
