Exp in Velks is pretty darn good..when you can get a train free camp.  The Back Room at zone in is good, but that was camped last night.  Also...if you can get highier to the top, then there will be no spiders running down the ramps to chase someone to zone.  Just takes some exploring there to get used to the ramps and learn all the slippery spots is all.<P>Another good exp spot is the "Village" which is the area we passed the 1st time we went there with Red Sky, but it's usually camped.  A real good spot is in the "Pits".  There are tons of rooms down there u can setup camps in, but it takes a full group with cleric, evacer, enchanter/53+ bard, tank to do it well.  Lot of named with good loots pop down there too.<P>I explored the castle area yesterday too and there are some good potential camps there too, but again...need a full group to really try them with any chance of success.<P>Sleethr and I'm pretty sure that Verser has his Seb Key.  Ghall does too.  I've only been there once or twice with Sleethr way back when...so no real exp there.<P>Not sure about Alpha Group faction yet, I'm kinda leaning towards going giant just to do something different.<P>I do know Brinne and Brod could use some extra exp, so maybe they would be interested in hanging with you and helping you help them out some.<P>--------------------<P>Verser - Bard of the 51st Song
